/paseka
/bin/
.tmp/
paseka-export-*.html
paseka-export-*.md
/site/
/.venv-docs/
/docs/llms-full.txt
# Archify viewer HTML + visual-check sidecars (built by scripts/render-archify.sh)
/docs/**/*.html
/docs/**/*.visual-check.*
**/__pycache__/
docker/dev/.env

# Queen Console production bundle (built by `pnpm --dir web build`).
# Not committed: `ui/fallback.html` alone is what a source-only Go build
# embeds, and release / container builds produce the bundle before compiling Go.
/internal/console/ui/dist/

# GoReleaser's artifact directory. It exists before the binaries are compiled,
# and an untracked path makes the toolchain stamp `vcs.modified=true`, which
# reaches the release binary as a `.dirty` version — so the tree a release is cut
# from has to look clean to git.
/dist/
